        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "A rectangular chintz palampore with all-over floral design. Central circular medallion filled with flowers.  8 tear-drop-shaped elements point inwards from the sides and corners of the field. Floral meander border. Red silk lining."@en ;
